.\n\n3.**Logical Deductions:**.\n   - From the context, we know that the lion eats the squirrel.\n   - The statement "If something chases the lion and it eats the squirrel then the squirrel sees the tiger" can be applied here.If the lion chases the squirrel, it must not see the tiger.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
