information does not explicitly state that all smooth things are loud.It only mentions that loud things are smooth.\n\nHence, we cannot conclusively affirm that Fiona is loud according to the provided misinformation.\n\n### Verdict:.\nThe statement "Fiona is loud" is **uncertain** based on the given misinformation\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
