el\'s behavior:**.\n   - The squirrel chases the rabbit.\n   - The rabbit chases the cow.\n   - The rabbit does not chase the dog.\n   - The squirrel likes the cow.\n\n3.**Check the conditions for the squirrel:**.\n   - The squirrel is young (given in the context).\n   - If someone is young, they do not see the dog.Since the squirrel is young, it does not see the dog.\n   - The squirrel likes the cow (given in the context).\n   - If someone likes the cow, they see the cow.Since the squirrel likes the cow, it must see the cow.\n\n4.**Check the rabbit\'s behavior:**.The squirrel sees the rabbit.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
