at directly links the bear to visiting the mouse.\n\n3.**Mouse and Tiger Relationship:**.\n   - The context states: "The mouse likes the tiger.Given the information provided, there is direct and indirect confirmation that the bear visits the mouse.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
