ot cold.\n   - Since Gary is blue and not specified as furry, this statement applies to Gary.\n\n8.**Not all warm, red people are furry.**.\n   - This is an unconditional statement: If warm and red → furry.\n   - Since Bob is blue and we know Gary is blue and not furry, this statement applies to Bob.\n\nFrom the analysis, we can conclude:.\n- Bob is not white.\n- Bob is loud because he is not nice and loud (as per the given unconditional statement)\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
