 the rabbit chases the lion.".\n   - Since the rabbit needs the bald eagle, and the rabbit needs the cow, it follows that the rabbit needs the cow.\n\n4.**Rabbit Visits the Cow:**.\n   - The context states: "If someone needs the rabbit and the rabbit visits the cow then the rabbit is big.".\n   - Since the rabbit needs the cow and the rabbit visits the cow, it follows that the rabbit is big.\nThe rabbit is not big and does not visit the cow.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
